  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(3)/(7) of (5)/(11)+(8)/(7)div(24)/(21)-(11)/(56)times(18)/(33)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(3)/(7) of (5)/(11)+(8)/(7)div(24)/(21)-(11)/(56)times(18)/(33)\n\n⇒ (15)/(77)+(8)/(7)times(21)/(24)-(11)/(56)times(18)/(33)\n\n⇒ (15)/(77)+(3)/(3)-(11)/(56)times(18)/(33)\n\n⇒ (15)/(77)+1-(3)/(28)\n\n⇒ (60+308-33)/(308)\n\n⇒ (335)/(308)\n\n**∴ The required answer is (335)/(308).**",
